==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fro}} {{term|regent|lang=fro}}, from {{etyl|la}} {{term|regens||ruling, as a noun, a ruler, governor, prince|lang=la}}; present participle of {{term|rego|regō|lang=la|I govern, I steer}}.

===Noun===
{{wikipedia}}
{{en-noun}}

